abstract: "U.S. accountants and auditors earned a median $83,680 a year in May 2025 and held about 1.6 million jobs, projected to grow 5% by 2035. Bookkeeping clerks earned a median $50,670 and their jobs are projected to fall 6%. This repository has 51 figures like these in one CSV, each linked to its BLS, Census, SBA or IRS source."
